    {"name": "Adjectives", "cards": [
      ["tall: comparative and superlative", "taller, tallest"],
      ["good: comparative and superlative", "better, best"],
      ["bad: comparative and superlative", "worse, worst"],
      ["big: comparative and superlative", "bigger, biggest"],
      ["happy: comparative and superlative", "happier, happiest"],
      ["beautiful: comparative and superlative", "more beautiful, most beautiful"],
      ["many or much: comparative and superlative", "more, most"],
      ["little: comparative and superlative", "less, least"],
      ["The comparative is used for ___ things, with the word ___", "two things, with than"],
      ["The superlative is used for ___ things, with the word ___", "three or more things, with the"]
